  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies on the curve traced by the&nbsp;mid-points of the line segments of the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;between the&nbsp;co-ordinates axes, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to</p>"
  },
